<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Password updated | Readora</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 24px; font: 16px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; color: #f4f1ff; background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, #3a2865, #14121d 55%); }
        main { width: min(100%, 460px); padding: 36px; border: 1px solid #ffffff24; border-radius: 20px; background: #211d2bef; box-shadow: 0 24px 70px #0008; text-align: center; }
        .mark { display: grid; width: 52px; height: 52px; margin: auto; place-items: center; color: #211d2b; background: #c5a8ff; border-radius: 50%; font-size: 1.6rem; }
        h1 { margin: 18px 0 8px; }
        p { color: #c5c0d0; }
        a { display: block; margin-top: 20px; padding: 13px; color: #1b1428; background: #c5a8ff; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main>
        <div class="mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
        <h1>Password updated</h1>
        <p>Your password has been changed successfully. You can now sign in with your new password.</p>
        <a href="{{loginUrl}}">Continue to login</a>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
